  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>超级RPG字体</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">说明</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">得益于这款现代、独特且易于阅读的流畅风格字体，您的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升。该字体专为<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>整合包制作，现已向公众开放！<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基于Jovanny Lemonad所设计的流行Google字体<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Russo One\" rel=\"nofollow\">Russo One</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">该字体遵循开放字体许可证。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/634/russo-one-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截图（来自DarkRPG）</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/413/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/414/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/412/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/415/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就获取服务器，与好友一起畅玩！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，使用优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折优惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
